LAST-MODIFIED:20260427T125149Z
UID:10043590-1777572000-1777582800@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:Country Club Thursday with Pressley Laton
DESCRIPTION: Head to the showroom for live country and southern rock\, partnered up with $5 beer\, $10 old-Fashioned & espresso martini specials! No cover.\n\nPressley Laton brings a sound that lives somewhere between outlaw country grit and Southern rock swagger\, shaped by Appalachian roots and small-town stories. Her bold\, soulful vocals and unfiltered songwriting have earned comparisons to “Lynyrd Skynyrd meets Jo Dee Messina\,” and it makes sense once the band kicks in. Expect a high-energy set that hits just as hard in a packed room as it does when she leans into the lyrics. Catch her live in the Showroom at Fitz and the Wolfe for a night that’s raw\, loud\, and very real.\n  \nFitz\, she’s the party. Wolfe\, he’s the epicure. 2 levels\, 3 vibes. 🎶 Live Music |🍸Sips & Noms 🥪 | 🕹️ Artcade | 🗝️Speakeasy | Private Events \nFitz and the Wolfe is a cocktail and music venue shaped by the spirit of improvisation\, storytelling\, and the kind of nights that feel too good to end. Here\, every night brings a new soundtrack. Jazz\, swing\, honky-tonk\, and sometimes things a little more esoteric—if it moves people\, we book it. The music fills the space like a second heartbeat\, sometimes rowdy\, sometimes intimate\, always memorable. It’s not background noise. It’s the reason you’re here. fitzandthewolfe.com
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/pressley-laton/
LOCATION:Fitz and the Wolfe\, 1 Battery Park Ave\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Screenshot-2026-04-25-092304-e1777123589663.png
GEO:35.5954515;-82.5548502
